      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "You are a university student who has failed Calculus way too many times.\nWith
    the final exam tomorrow, you make a desperate decision.\nThe night before the
    test, you sneak into SB-multisal to search for the hidden exam answers.\nRumor
    says the answers are somewhere inside the building\u2026\nFind the answers. Survive
    the night. Pass Calculus.\n\nOBJECTIVE\nFind 10 hidden exam answers.\nOnce all
    10 are collected, the exit will unlock.\nEscape the building to win.\nAvoid whatever
    is lurking inside.\n\nCONTROLS\nMove \u2013 W A S D\nJump \u2013 Space\nCrouch
    \u2013 Left Ctrl\nSprint \u2013 Left Shift\nCollect Item \u2013 E"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
